1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,280
Rory M: Do you remember when we played Catten with Bobby last week?

2
00:00:03,630 --> 00:00:07,050
Dev M: Yeah. Four hours. He wouldn't let anyone trade for wood.

3
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:10,790
Rory M: Don't you get a feeling... when you watch him play like that?

4
00:00:11,290 --> 00:00:15,100
Dev M: Wha... what do you mean? Like rage? Because yeah, I felt that.

5
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:19,910
Rory M: No, not rage. It's like a warmth, right in my chest.

6
00:00:19,810 --> 00:00:22,640
Dev M: That's acid reflux, mate. That's the Doritos.

7
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:29,670
Rory M: The way he moves the pieces. The way he builds. That long... long road of his.

8
00:00:29,970 --> 00:00:32,570
Dev M: I... guess? It was twelve roads long.

9
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:37,230
Rory M: Twelve roads. Exactly, twelve whole roads.

10
00:00:37,730 --> 00:00:39,810
Dev M: Rory. Mate. It's a board game.

11
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:45,950
Rory M: He didn't even look at the dice. Just a flick of the wrist. Nine. Of course it was a nine.

12
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:48,810
Dev M: I thought he was just good at it...

13
00:00:49,410 --> 00:00:53,520
Rory M: So... you also find him sexy when he plays Catten?
